      "GLYNN: What's the matter? It was good.\nSARA: Everybody there's going to be good, Mom. I have to be better. My knees still knock when I do my free form. Did you notice that?\nGLYNN: I noticed that it was fine.\nSARA: It's not supposed to be fine. It's supposed to be special.",
